    <statement><p>The region 
bounded by <m>y=e^{2 x},y=0,x=-1,x=0</m>
is rotated around the <m>x</m>-axis.
Find the volume.</p>
<p>volume = <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>0.771013094252786</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><me>V=\int_{-1}^{0}\pi y^2\,dx = \int_{-1}^{0}\pi(e^{2 x})^2\,dx = 
\int_{-1}^{0}\pi e^{4 x}\,dx</me>
<me>= \frac{\pi}{4}e^{4 x}\bigg|_{-1}^{0} =
\frac{\pi}{4}(e^{0} - e^{-4}).</me>



</solution>
